# Raw and derived data is regenerable by the build scripts and can reach
# many GB once the 20 m lake is built (AGENTS.md sections 10, 48). Never commit it.
#
# ANCHORED with a leading slash on purpose. Unanchored, "data/" matches a directory
# named data at ANY depth, which silently excluded 12 SOURCE files from version
# control: frontend/src/sim/data/ (the entire Python->browser data seam: codec.ts,
# manifest.ts, source.ts and their tests) and scripts/data/ (build_lake.py,
# verify_lake.py, inventory.py and the download scripts). They were never committed and
# a `git clean -xdf` would have deleted them with no trace in history.
/data/
frontend/public/sim/
env_sim/
artifacts/schema_audit/*.csv
artifacts/schema_audit/*.json
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Download manifests record absolute machine-specific destinations (AGENTS.md section 5)
artifacts/download_manifests/

# Python virtual environment (CP-00); rebuilt from requirements.txt
.venv/
venv/
